Apply now and become part of our team.", "content2": "<p>Location: Pecatu, Uluwatu - Bali (Preffer to candidates who currently reside within approximately 20–30 minutes of the villa location in Pecatu, Uluwatu.)</p><p>Employment Type: Full Time</p><p>Salary: Rp5.000.000/month + Sales Incentive/Commission</p><p>About the Position:</p><p>We are looking for a proactive, communicative, and hospitality-oriented Villa Sales, Reservation &amp; Operations Officer to manage daily villa operations while supporting sales, reservations, OTA management, and guest relations.</p><p>This position is suitable for someone who can work independently, is comfortable communicating with guests, and has a strong understanding of hospitality operations and online booking platforms.</p><p>Key Responsibilities</p><p>1. OTA &amp; Reservation</p><p>Manage villa listings and reservations through OTA platforms such as Booking.com, Agoda, Airbnb, Expedia, etc.</p><p>Monitor room availability, rates, promotions, and inventory.</p><p>Respond to guest inquiries promptly and professionally.</p><p>Handle booking confirmations, cancellations, modifications, and special requests.</p><p>Maintain an accurate reservation calendar and prevent double bookings.</p><p>Follow up with potential guests to convert inquiries into bookings.</p><p>Prepare daily/weekly reservation reports.</p><p>2. Sales &amp; Revenue</p><p>Generate direct bookings through WhatsApp, Instagram, website, referrals, and other channels.</p><p>Follow up leads and potential customers.</p><p>Develop relationships with travel agents, tour operators, and local partners.</p><p>Promote villa packages and special offers.</p><p>Upsell additional services such as airport transfers, breakfast, BBQ, tours, transportation, etc.</p><p>Achieve agreed monthly occupancy and revenue targets.</p><p>Monitor competitor rates and market conditions.</p><p>3. Guest Relations &amp; Concierge</p><p>Communicate with guests before, during, and after their stay.</p><p>Coordinate check-in and check-out arrangements.</p><p>Assist guests with transportation, restaurant reservations, tours, activities, and other requests.</p><p>Handle guest complaints professionally and coordinate solutions.</p><p>Ensure guests receive a positive and personalized experience.</p><p>Follow up on guest feedback and online reviews.</p><p>4. Villa Operations</p><p>Conduct daily villa readiness and operational checks.</p><p>Ensure the villa and public areas are clean, presentable, and guest-ready.</p><p>Coordinate with Housekeeping, Maintenance, Garden, and Pool teams.</p><p>Monitor amenities, linen, guest supplies, and operational inventory.</p><p>Report maintenance issues and follow up on completion.</p><p>Ensure operational standards are maintained.</p><p>Assist management in implementing SOPs and improving guest experience.</p><p>5. Public Area Monitoring</p><p>Monitor cleanliness and presentation of entrance, pool area, garden, terrace, parking area, and other public areas.</p><p>Coordinate cleaning and maintenance requirements.</p><p>Ensure all public areas are safe, clean, and ready for guests.</p><p>Requirements</p><p>Minimum education: SMA/SMK/Diploma in Hospitality, Tourism, Business, or related field.</p><p>Minimum 1–2 years of experience in hotel, villa, resort, reservation, sales, or hospitality operations.</p><p>Experience handling OTA platforms is preferred.</p><p>Good knowledge of reservation processes and hospitality operations.</p><p>Good communication skills in Bahasa Indonesia and English.</p><p>Strong customer service and problem-solving skills.</p><p>Comfortable using WhatsApp, email, Microsoft Office/Google Workspace, and basic Excel.</p><p>Able to work independently with minimal supervision.</p><p>Able to coordinate multiple operational tasks.</p><p>Target-oriented and willing to work with sales targets.</p><p>Well-groomed, professional, friendly, and service-oriented.</p><p>Willing to work weekends, public holidays, and according to villa operational requirements.</p><p>Having a valid driving license and own transportation is an advantage.</p><p>Key Skills</p><p>Must Have</p><p>OTA management</p><p>Reservation handling</p><p>Guest communication</p><p>Basic sales skills</p><p>English communication</p><p>Microsoft Office / Google Workspace</p><p>Problem solving</p><p>Operational coordination</p><p>Preferred</p><p>Booking.com / Agoda / Airbnb experience</p><p>PMS experience</p><p>Revenue management knowledge</p><p>Travel agent/networking experience</p><p>Social media and digital marketing knowledge</p><p>Experience in villa operations</p>", "status": "Active", "isExpired": false, "isLinkOut": false, "isVerified": true, "expiresAt": {"dateTimeUtc": "2026-09-24T13:59:59.999Z", "__typename": "SeekDateTime"}, "listedAt": {"dateTimeUtc": "2026-08-25T01:18:35.677Z", "__typename": "SeekDateTime"}, "salary": {"currencyLabel": null, "label": "Rp 5.000.000 – Rp 6.000.000 per month", "__typename": "JobSalary"}, "workTypes": {"label": "Full time", "__typename": "JobWorkTypes"}, "advertiser": {"id": "63839774", "name": "The Mahaloka Uluwatu", "isVerified": null, "registrationDate": {"dateTimeUtc": "2026-08-21T13:01:12.984Z", "__typename": "SeekDateTime"}, "__typename": "Advertiser"}, "location": {"label": "Badung, Bali", "__typename": "LocationInfo"}, "classifications": [{"label": "Reservasi (Hospitaliti & Pariwisata)", "__typename": "ClassificationInfo"}], "products": {"bullets": null, "branding": null, "questionnaire": {"questions": ["Berapa gaji bulanan yang kamu inginkan?", "Berapa tahun pengalaman kerjamu sebagai Petugas Operasional?", "Kualifikasi mana yang kamu miliki?", "How many years experience in Resort Management do you have?", "Apakah kamu memiliki pengalaman Perencanaan Perjalanan?"], "__typename": "JobQuestionnaire"}, "video": null, "__typename": "JobProducts"}, "__typename": "Job"}, "workArrangements": {"arrangements": [{"type": "ONSITE", "label": "Kantor", "__typename": "JobDetailsWorkArrangement"}], "label": "", "__typename": "JobDetailsWorkArrangements"}, "seoInfo": {"normalisedRoleTitle": "Operations Officer", "workType": "242", "classification": ["1212"], "subClassification": ["6056"], "where": "Badung Bali", "broaderLocationName": "Badung", "normalisedOrganisationName": null, "__typename": "SEOInfo"}, "companyProfile": null, "companySearchUrl": "https://id.jobstreet.com/id/jobs?advertiserid=63839774", "companyTags": [], "__typename": "JobDetails"}}

